OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry into death of farm worker
OL,4,Ain storage shed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a farm worker at a storage
OL,7,Fshed in Stirlingshire will be examined
OL,8,Fat a fatal accident inquiry (FAI).
OL,10,FAlistair Blair, 64, a farmhand employed
OL,11,Fby Graham's The Family Dairy, died on 4
OL,12,FNovember 2024 after sustaining fatal
OL,13,Finjuries at Birkenwood Farm near
OL,14,FKippen.
OL,16,FA preliminary hearing will take place
OL,17,Fon 11 December at Stirling Sheriff
OL,18,FCourt.
OL,20,FFAIs are used to establish facts rather
OL,21,Fthan to apportion blame.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
